# Every source file under this directory is text, and is to be diffed as text
# whichever bytes happen to be inside a string literal.
#
# `record.ts` is why. Its correction key joins six fields with a byte that can
# occur in none of them, which was written as a literal NUL until 30 September —
# so `git` classified the module holding this surface's merge rules as binary and
# printed `Bin 13206 -> 14798 bytes` in place of every diff of it, for as long as
# nobody happened to need one. The literal is now an escape, which fixes that file;
# this fixes the class, because the next separator somebody needs will be a
# judgement about a key rather than a judgement about reviewability.
*.ts diff
*.tsx diff
